msgstr "Belum ada prediksi aliran sungai yang tersedia."

msgid "River flow (m³/s)"
msgstr "Aliran sungai (m³/dtk)"

msgid "Your Alerts"
msgstr "Peringatan Anda"

msgid "Alert Type"
msgstr "Jenis Peringatan"

msgid "Phone Number"
msgstr "Nomor Telepon"

msgid "Verified"
msgstr "Terverifikasi"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ya"

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verifikasi"

msgid "View/Edit"
msgstr "Lihat/Edit"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Hapus"

msgid "You have no alerts set up. Click \"Add New\" to create one."
msgstr "Anda belum mengatur peringatan apa pun. Klik \"Tambah Baru\" untuk membuatnya."

msgid "Add new"
msgstr "Tambah baru"

msgid "Save alert"
msgstr "Simpan peringatan"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

msgid "Delete alert?"
msgstr "Hapus peringatan?"

msgid "Are you sure you want to delete this alert?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda yakin ingin menghapus peringatan ini?"

msgid "Verify Phone Number"
msgstr "Verifikasi Nomor Telepon"

msgid "Verification code has been sent to"
msgstr "Kode verifikasi telah dikirim ke"

msgid "Enter it below."
msgstr "Masukkan di bawah ini."

msgid "Resend Code"
msgstr "Kirim Ulang Kode"

msgid "Log In"
msgstr "Masuk"

msgid "Reset password"
msgstr "Atur ulang kata sandi"

msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Daftar"

msgid "Forgot your password?"
msgstr "Lupa kata sandi Anda?"

msgid "Enter your email address below, and we'll email instructions for setting a new one."
msgstr "Masukkan alamat email Anda di bawah ini, dan kami akan mengirimkan instruksi untuk membuat kata sandi baru melalui email."

msgid "Send password reset"
msgstr "Kirim atur ulang kata sandi"

msgid "Password reset sent"
msgstr "Permintaan atur ulang kata sandi terkirim"

msgid "We’ve emailed you instructions for setting your password, if an account exists with the email you entered. You should receive them shortly."
msgstr "Kami telah mengirimkan instruksi melalui email untuk mengatur kata sandi Anda, jika akun dengan email yang Anda masukkan ada. Anda akan segera menerimanya."

msgid "If you don’t receive an email, please make sure you’ve entered the address you registered with, and check your spam folder."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak menerima email, pastikan Anda telah memasukkan alamat yang Anda gunakan saat mendaftar, dan periksa folder spam Anda."

msgid "Enter new password"
msgstr "Masukkan kata sandi baru"

msgid "Change password"
msgstr "Ubah kata sandi"

msgid "The password reset link was invalid, possibly because it has already been used."
msgstr "Tautan atur ulang kata sandi tidak valid, mungkin karena sudah digunakan."

msgid "Please"
msgstr "Silakan"

msgid "request a new password reset"
msgstr "minta atur ulang kata sandi baru"

msgid "Password reset complete"
msgstr "Atur ulang kata sandi selesai"

msgid "Your new password has been set. You can log in now on the"
msgstr "Kata sandi baru Anda telah diatur. Anda sekarang dapat masuk di"

msgid "log in page"
msgstr "halaman masuk"

msgid "I have agreed to the <a href=\"\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#privacy-modal\">Privacy Policy</a>"
msgstr "Saya telah menyetujui <a href=\"\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#privacy-modal\">Kebijakan Privasi</a>"

msgid "A user with this email address already exists."
msgstr "Pengguna dengan alamat email ini sudah ada."

msgid "You must provide a new phone number or choose an existing one."
msgstr "Anda harus memberikan nomor telepon baru atau memilih salah satu yang sudah ada."

msgid "Unable to verify phone number. Please check the number and try again."
msgstr "Tidak dapat memverifikasi nomor telepon. Periksa nomornya dan coba lagi."

msgid "Alert added. Please check your messages to verify it."
msgstr "Peringatan ditambahkan. Periksa pesan Anda untuk memverifikasinya."

msgid "Use the toolbox to select an area on the map."
msgstr "Gunakan kotak alat untuk memilih area pada peta."

msgid "Verification succeeded."
msgstr "Verifikasi berhasil."

msgid "Verification failed. Please try again."
msgstr "Verifikasi gagal. Silakan coba lagi."

msgid "We have sent a verification code to %(phone_number)s. Use the 'Verify' button to enter the code to verify your alert."
msgstr "Kami telah mengirimkan kode verifikasi ke %(phone_number)s. Gunakan tombol 'Verifikasi' untuk memasukkan kode dan memverifikasi peringatan Anda."

msgid "Unable to send verification code to %(phone_number)s. Please check the number and try again."
msgstr "Tidak dapat mengirim kode verifikasi ke %(phone_number)s. Periksa nomornya dan coba lagi."

